And in fact, that's what makes us so sure
that it's happening, that it is not atypical

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:16.370
for Russia to be meddling in others elections.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:20.230
The difference is other countries seem more
committed in stopping them.

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:23.900
Other countries seem more interested in preventing
it from happening.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:27.360
Now let's go to the next disclaimer.

